p;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 지원 시 등록 학기가 최소 1년 이상 남아 있어야 함.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;휴학생 지원가능, 대학원생 지원 불가.</span></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 복수학위생 - 파견 당시 3학기 이상 등록한 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;파견기간 : 3학기이상(본교) + 4학기(중국대학) </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;한어수평고시(HSK) 5급 이상 소지자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (수학능력 부족 시 사</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">전&nbsp;개별 어학연수 실시)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 성적평점평균 3.0 이상 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 중국어 강의 수강능력자(학점 취득 가능한 자)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#20b2aa\"><strong>4. 선발기준(공통)</strong></font> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 배점 : 학부성적 50%, 인터뷰(면접) 50%(외국어 30%, 태도/동기 20%)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=